  "message": "I can help with that. Because closing an account and opening a new account require accessing and changing your customer records, I’ll need to verify your identity first. Please tell me which identifier you’d like me to use to look up your account: your Rho user ID, the email on file, or your full name (case-sensitive). After I retrieve your record I’ll ask you to confirm any 2 of the following on-file items: date of birth, email, phone number, or address. Once we’ve verified you I can (1) close the empty Green checking account and (2) help open a savings account (I’ll ask a couple quick questions about how you want the savings set up—e.g., whether to link it to your Silver checking and whether you want an initial deposit). Would you like to proceed with verification now, or would you prefer to speak with a human agent instead?"
}
